  "summary": "Reusable, source- and community-agnostic conversion records. Three separate concepts with one shared approval / audit trail: conversion_adjustments (balanced transformations; database fingerprint; owner approval in the app bound to it), conversion_policies (approved non-journal instructions: cutoff authority, legacy-owner routing, suspense, timing, preserve source coding) and conversion_exceptions (the 452 table extended for activity-bridge resolutions); conversion_object_events (append-only). The persisted normalized source (onboarding_source_fact_sets / onboarding_source_facts; a normalize PASS must carry its sealed set). Needs only the onboarding engine core (481-484). Changes no existing row.",
  "requires": [
    "481_onboarding_engine.sql",
    "482_onboarding_service.sql",
    "483_onboarding_snapshot.sql",
    "484_onboarding_activity_bridge.sql"
  ],
