  "expected_changes": [
    "Creates conversion_object_events (append-only; approve / reject only by a human with channel in_app and a fingerprint).",
    "Creates conversion_adjustments and conversion_policies: content immutable after insert; fingerprint computed by a trigger over the content; created 'proposed'; status changes only inside conversion_decide_object / a superseding proposal; an approval needs who, when and channel in_app; one live adjustment number and one live policy per kind + key per batch; a suspense policy can never allocate to owners.",
    "Extends conversion_exceptions (exception_source, completion_event_id, event_key, classification, resolution, method, confidence, amount_cents, evidence, proposed_resolution; status also 'auto_resolved'); bridge rows are permanent. Existing (staging) rows are untouched and keep their default exception_source 'staging'.",
    "Creates onboarding_source_fact_sets / onboarding_source_facts (append-only, sealed by count, bound once) and a trigger: a normalize PASS must carry its sealed fact set.",
    "Functions conversion_propose_adjustment / conversion_propose_policy / conversion_decide_object / onboarding_conversion_objects_digest / conversion_objects_view / onboarding_record_exceptions / onboarding_open_fact_set / onboarding_append_source_facts / onboarding_seal_fact_set / onboarding_fact_set_view / onboarding_source_facts_page: service_role only.",
    "No row in any existing table changes."
  ],
